nv-codec-headers 12.1.14.0 (https://git.videolan.org/?p=ffmpeg/nv-codec-headers.git),
copied unmodified from Ubuntu's libffmpeg-nvenc-dev package: the NVENC API
definitions (nvEncodeAPI.h, NVIDIA, MIT) and FFmpeg's dlopen() loader for
libcuda/libnvidia-encode (dynlink_*.h, MIT). See COPYING. Vendored so the
NVENC backend builds without an NVIDIA SDK or driver installed; the driver
it runs against must support NVENC API 12.1 (R530 or newer).
